 muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776590/extras/3b0008eede50e07a544d323b4bd64baf.poster.avif?t=1704407165\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776590/extras/3b0008eede50e07a544d323b4bd64baf.webm?t=1704407165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Gameplay mechanics are very simple - destroy all enemies and try to avoid every bullet... well, at least those which can be avoided. Your special maneuver allows you to dodge normal projectiles. Even if you get hit, you will only lose one extra weapon! However, watch out for powerful bosses! They can thorn you into pieces with their ultimate unavoidable attacks!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776590/extras/be8569cc26a6d53e01b6d6f8a948c4b4.poster.avif?t=1704407165\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776590/extras/be8569cc26a6d53e01b6d6f8a948c4b4.webm?t=1704407165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
